<p>BTS returned to the stage in central Seoul on March 21 for its first full live show together since October 2022, turning Gwanghwamun Square into the launch site for a comeback that drew huge crowds in person and online. Reports described the concert as a homecoming for one of South Korea’s biggest cultural exports, with the group performing material from its new album “Arirang” and kicking off a world tour that organizers say spans 34 regions and 82 shows through 2027. The event also prompted an unusually large public operation in Seoul. Police restricted access around the historic city center, and officials prepared for very large attendance, with BBC reporting that about 260,000 fans were expected across the site and surrounding areas. The concert stirred excitement among fans who traveled from abroad and waited hours for a view of the stage, but it also drew criticism from people who questioned whether too many public resources were being devoted to a corporate entertainment production in a major civic space.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/ux9WxVr1zira1jn3MLoWhqlZzQZ2M4oIMFSBE_bKQMi6ZeYK9wQjYQ20tOi1LNNj6veVe7vWEhMgMKeibhLvGZz2N2Ri5I10I0jDZ-9A0C10mNJrnjeeHhncqMm_gXLZkNUKzGRnV9myxTJ3QKBR0fqTMl4hY-5Xm4C7oqvajH2W7ozqJ8uMf_vdHZhSZm7GWyHgF6il-AU9i-HmSgE8IjdEQcc' alt='Gwanghwamun Square in Seoul on Saturday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Free concert: SCMP reported that the Seoul comeback show was free to attend, even as Netflix streamed it globally as an exclusive event, giving fans broader access beyond ticketed arena audiences.</li><li>Member comeback: All seven members — RM, Jin, Suga, J-Hope, Jimin, V and Jung Kook — had recently completed South Korea’s mandatory military service before reuniting for the concert.</li><li>Fan dedication: Some fans without tickets arrived before sunrise and waited as long as 15 hours to secure clear views near the venue, underscoring the group’s exceptionally committed international following.</li><li>Onstage setback: RM performed despite an ankle injury during the homecoming show, according to live coverage from The New York Times.</li><li>Soft power: The New York Times described BTS as a pivotal force in South Korean soft power, showing why the comeback mattered beyond entertainment.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Seoul city critics: Some critics argued that staging the show in central Seoul consumed too many public resources for a corporate production, raising questions about policing, traffic controls and access to public space. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/21/world/asia/bts-seoul-concert-korea-criticism.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>International fans: Fans interviewed in Seoul said the concert was worth the long waits and long-distance travel, with some arriving before dawn to claim spots with unobstructed views of the stage. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/21/world/asia/bts-fans-concert-seoul.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>South Korean organizers and officials: Authorities and organizers prepared for exceptionally large crowds in the historic center, locking down parts of central Seoul and treating the show as a city-scale event. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/east-asia/article/3347405/ahead-bts-first-show-years-south-korean-police-lock-down-central-seoul'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/bts-are-back-central-seoul-locks-down-for-k-pop-supergroups-first-show-in-years/article70768287.ece'>BTS are back: central Seoul locks down for K-pop supergroup&#x27;s first show in years</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/03/21/world/bts-netflix-concert-arirang'>Live Updates: BTS’s Comeback Show Was Heavy on Their New Album</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.boston.com/culture/entertainment/2026/03/21/bts-returns-with-comeback-concert-in-seoul-after-4-year-hiatus/'>BTS returns with comeback concert in Seoul after 4-year hiatus</a> - boston.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cge0dyjwezgo'>First photos as BTS make live return in front of huge crowd</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/east-asia/article/3347405/ahead-bts-first-show-years-south-korean-police-lock-down-central-seoul'>South Korea’s BTS play first gig together in nearly 4 years</a> - scmp.com</li></ul>